        <li><a href="https://www.maine.gov/dafs/ocp/sites/maine.gov.dafs.ocp/files/inline-files/18-691%20CMR%20Ch%2020%20Final.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OCP Chapter 20: Licenses and Licensing, effective November 6, 2024</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.maine.gov/dafs/ocp/adult-use/application-process/iic-instructions" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OCP Individual Identification Card application instructions</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.maine.gov/dafs/ocp/adult-use/application-process/criminal-history" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OCP criminal history records check instructions</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.maine.gov/dafs/ocp/adult-use/applications-forms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OCP applications and forms</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="disclaimer">
      <p><strong>Compliance notice:</strong> This guide is general information, not legal or employment advice. Confirm current requirements with OCP and qualified counsel for a specific role or applicant.</p>
    </section>

